    <entry>
      <title>图片瀑布流演示</title>
      <link href="/posts/bbbf239f.html"/>
      <url>/posts/bbbf239f.html</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>这是一篇展示 Nexmoe 瀑布流功能的示例文章。</p><h2 id="图片瀑布流">图片瀑布流</h2><p>使用 <code>&#123;% gallery %&#125;</code> 标签包裹图片即可，每张图片会以瀑布流（masonry）布局排列：</p><p><div class="gallery-pro" style="column-width:200px;"><div><img alt="天空" src="https://picsum.photos/seed/sky/400/600" data-caption="天空" data-fancybox="gallery" loading="lazy"></div><div><img alt="海洋" src="https://picsum.photos/seed/sea/600/400" data-caption="海洋" data-fancybox="gallery" loading="lazy"></div><div><img alt="森林" src="https://picsum.photos/seed/forest/300/500" data-caption="森林" data-fancybox="gallery" loading="lazy"></div><div><img alt="山川" src="https://picsum.photos/seed/mountain/500/700" data-caption="山川" data-fancybox="gallery" loading="lazy"></div><div><img alt="城市" src="https://picsum.photos/seed/city/350/450" data-caption="城市" data-fancybox="gallery" loading="lazy"></div><div><img alt="星空" src="https://picsum.photos/seed/star/450/350" data-caption="星空" data-fancybox="gallery" loading="lazy"></div><div><img alt="花朵" src="https://picsum.photos/seed/flower/400/400" data-caption="花朵" data-fancybox="gallery" loading="lazy"></div><div><img alt="湖泊" src="https://picsum.photos/seed/lake/550/300" data-caption="湖泊" data-fancybox="gallery" loading="lazy"></div>            </div></p><h2 id="自定义列宽">自定义列宽</h2><p>可以在标签中指定列宽（单位 px）：</p><p><div class="gallery-pro" style="column-width:250px;"><div><img alt="沙漠" src="https://picsum.photos/seed/desert/400/500" data-caption="沙漠" data-fancybox="gallery" loading="lazy"></div><div><img alt="冰川" src="https://picsum.photos/seed/ice/500/400" data-caption="冰川" data-fancybox="gallery" loading="lazy"></div><div><img alt="草原" src="https://picsum.photos/seed/grass/350/550" data-caption="草原" data-fancybox="gallery" loading="lazy"></div><div><img alt="火山" src="https://picsum.photos/seed/volcano/450/350" data-caption="火山" data-fancybox="gallery" loading="lazy"></div>            </div></p><h2 id="普通图片">普通图片</h2><p>不用标签的话，图片就是普通排列：</p><p><img onerror="imgOnError(this);" data-fancybox="gallery" src="https://picsum.photos/seed/normal/600/400" alt="普通图片" data-caption="普通图片" loading="lazy"></p>]]></content>
      
      
